'''Lokii''' is a [[boss]] that can appear:
* {{dlc|nr}} In the {{s|Womb}} and the {{s|Utero}}.
* {{dlc+|r}} In all environments of [[Chapter 4]] ({{s|Womb}}, {{s|Utero}}, {{s|Scarred Womb}}).{{dlc-}}
Each half of Lokii has 350 HP.

== Behavior ==
The fight against Lokii resembles fighting two individual {{e|Loki}}s. Each half of Lokii teleports to random locations in the room and has the same attacks which they perform independently of each other:
* Shoots 4 projectiles in the four cardinal directions, followed by the four diagonal directions, and then the cardinal directions once again.
* Spawns a {{e|Red Boom Fly}} on top of himself. Only 1 Red Boom Fly can be alive at once.
* Shoots 8 projectiles in all directions.
Lokii deals a whole heart of contact damage.

